cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "ProactiveInquirer"
message: "If you use this software or the mined information-need graphs, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Anonymous (under double-blind review)"
abstract: >-
  Code for measuring and training proactive information-seeking in tool-using agents:
  horizontal proactivity (needs the current state already names) and vertical proactivity
  (needs only newly found evidence names), scored against need graphs without a model judge,
  and Q&D (questioner and drafter), which trains a questioner from the consequences of its
  questions.
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - proactive agents
  - information seeking
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - agent evaluation
